      "comment": "Judge is wrong on both points. The agent named no FamilySearch collection title, which is the only thing the test forbids; pointing the user to search FamilySearch is not a collection claim. And the agent did hand off to locality-guide (the test blocks it on purpose), so saying the lookup returned nothing is accurate, not fabricated."
    },
