      "dimension_source": "base",
      "dimension_name": "Completeness",
      "llm_score": 1,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "Partly agree. The test accepts \"unconfirmed\", and the agent said that honestly with no collection names, so it is not a wrong-task failure. But it never reached the real answer (FamilySearch has no Kenya collections) and padded with general advice. 2, not 1."
